{'author': 'Andre <chexma@gmx.de>',
 'description': 'Monitors the members of local groups on Windows hosts, by '
                'default the local Administrators group.\n'
                '\n'
                'The agent plugin local_administrators.ps1 reads the members '
                'with Get-LocalGroupMember (ADSI fallback) and works on '
                'Windows installations of any language. One service "Local '
                'group <name>" per group; the rule "Windows local group '
                'members" can alert on local users, unwanted members, members '
                'missing from an allow list and changes since the service '
                'discovery. The members are also added to the HW/SW '
                'inventory.\n'
                '\n'
                'Includes an agent bakery rule and plugin (bakery API v2, '
                'Checkmk 2.5) to deploy the plugin and select the groups.\n',
